    <description>9/16/26 - SS-13639 - Update the stagenumber value in Valid_Mapped_Opportunity element. 
7/9/26 - SS-13266 - Notify Primary PFS Territory Owner on Deal Registration Status Changes. 
6/15/26  : SS-13259  - Removed Owner:User.Level_2__c and Owner:User.Level_3__c reference in the Flow.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_ActionRequiredLogEntryMessage</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;An error has occurred in the &quot;OppReg_Acct_MGR_Expiry_Email_Notification11&quot; Email element&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Removed reference of Level 2 and Level 3 as part of field deprecation in SS-13259. 
Email notifications should always be sent to ChannelOps@tanium.com, Owner, and the Primary PFS Territory Owner on the Deal Registration record. This formula update also handles cases where the owner fields are blank. SS-13266</description>
        <name>formula_EmailRecipients</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;ChannelOps@tanium.com&apos; &amp;
IF(
    NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Owner:User.Email})), 
    &apos;,&apos; &amp; {!$Record.Owner:User.Email},
    &apos;&apos;
) &amp;
IF(
    NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Primary_PFS_Territory_Owner__r.Email})), 
    &apos;,&apos; &amp; {!$Record.Primary_PFS_Territory_Owner__r.Email},
    &apos;&apos;
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_ExpiryLogEntryMessage</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;An error has occurred in the &quot;OppReg_Acct_MGR_Expiry_Email_Notification111&quot; Email element&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_ExtensionLogEntryMessage</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;An error has occurred in the &quot;ACCT_MGR_Extension_Pending_Non_AVP_RVP&quot; Email element&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_PreExpiryLogEntryMessage</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;An error has occurred in the &quot;X4_OppReg_OppReg_PDD_Pre_Expiry&quot; Email element&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_RecordLink</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Label.SalesforceURL}&amp;&quot;/&quot;&amp;{!$Record.Id}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_Today</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>Today()</expression>
    </formulas>
